[Event "Giuoco Piano"]

{ Opening repertoire for white. } 1. e4 { Open Game. } 1... e5 { Black mirror's White's move. } 2. Nf3 { Attacks black's pawn. } 2... Nc6 3. Bc4 {In the Italian game, the bishop is developed to c4.} *

[Event "Spanish"]

1. e4 e5 { Controls the centre. } 2. Nf3 { Attacks black's pawn. } 2... Nc6 3. Bc4 {In the Spanish opening, the bishop is developed to b5.} *
